<title>SOUTH AFRICA: No applications for Oct-Dec S.Africa maize exports.</title>
<headline>No applications for Oct-Dec S.Africa maize exports.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Maize Board said on Tuesday it had received no applications from private traders to export maize during the period October 1 to December 31.  </p>
<p>South African private maize traders have this season (May-April) in total received permits to export 1.465 million tonnes of white and yellow maize. According to the maize scheme, traders may export up to 1.8 million tonnes of maize.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
